# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the context-root .dockerignore, and this
# build needs that: the root file is upstream-owned (filter `keep`) and excludes `.*` plus
# **/*.yml and **/*.md, which strips .mvn/community-maven.settings.xml — the settings the
# suite's pom needs to resolve ${repo.releases.url} — and the suite's own yaml/md resources.
.git/
**/target/
